window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The world ended, and with it, so did the rules.</b></p> <p>I was stolen from my family and raised in the wastelands to the north. I did what I had to ensure my survival. I became the Champion, with my history carved into my skin for all to see.</p> <p>Now, I spend my days drinking and hiding from my past, until four newcomers offer me a job I can't refuse. When my past and future mix, I must once again rise and fight. This time it's not for my freedom, it's for my happiness.</p> <p><i>Contains mature themes.</i></p>"; 
